Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Install the selected Cleanroom version

Download the release's MMC instance zip and install it into the
instance: its org.lwjgl (LWJGL 3) and net.minecraftforge (Cleanroom)
patches replace the existing components and the empty stub jars go to
the instance's local library folder.

Ask before replacing a regular Forge install. Afterwards let automatic
Java switching pick a compatible Java again, and warn when no Java
version Cleanroom accepts is going to be used.

